  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kenya Ports Authority - assessment on green shipping and green port policy initiatives</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kenya Ports Authority - assessment on green shipping and green port policy initiatives.


Mombasa port is the gateway to East and Central Africa serving over 250 million people in EAC region.

KPA has been supported through TMA for Mombasa and Kisumu port initiatives. The below request is to assist them assess if there are better ways the Mombasa port can integrate better green initiatives for optimal operations. 

This request is after the various visits, to help them do a study to be clear on the areas they need to address in the near future to be able to make an implementation plan to transition to a fully green port.</narrative>
  </description>
